      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAMPSON (1) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at Townsville over 498m behind Mizuki Heart (28.88) in a Grade 5. Should be very hard to beat this time. UNACCEPTABLE COL (6) was safely held in tougher company last start after missing the jump at this track, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at Capalaba (19.93) beating Outlaw Torque in a Grade 4/5 on September 6. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. A big run wouldn't surprise. MAKE 'EM RAIN (2) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 390m behind Party With Tom (22.99) in a Grade 5. One of the better hopes. SNAPPER ROCKS (4) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
